                    <span class="d-block">Expert Car Repair.</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="hero-slide-subtext">
                    From engine diagnostics to full-service fixes, we bring your vehicle back to life.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-slide-actions">
                    <a href="#status-tracker" class="btn-hero-book-repair">
                        <span>Book Your Repair</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Slide 2: Creative & Professional (Current Design Writing) -->
            <div class="hero-slide-item" data-slide-index="1">
                <div class="hero-slide-kicker">GARIJ WORKSHOP</div>
                <h2 class="hero-slide-title">
                    <span class="d-block">Creative &amp;</span>
                    <span class="d-block">Professional.</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="hero-slide-subtext">
                    Comprehensive restorations, high-precision electronic diagnostics, suspension recalibration, and bespoke performance tuning.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-slide-actions">
                    <a href="#services" class="btn-hero-book-repair">
                        <span>Explore Services</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Slide 3: Heritage & Integrity (Current Design Writing) -->
            <div class="hero-slide-item" data-slide-index="2">
                <div class="hero-slide-kicker">PRECISION CRAFTSMANSHIP</div>
                <h2 class="hero-slide-title">
                    <span class="d-block">25 Years Reputation</span>
                    <span class="d-block">Full Integrity.</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="hero-slide-subtext">
                    Complete transparency with digital work orders, itemized genuine parts logs, upfront pricing, and live telemetry tracking.
                </p>
                <div class="hero-slide-actions">
                    <a href="#status-tracker" class="btn-hero-book-repair">
